    "accounts.changeAccount.addServerFooter" : {
      "comment" : "Apple Change Account (iPhone, iPad, Mac): footer under the Add Server row: the explanation sentence with a full stop. {detail}: one of the accounts.addServerDetail.* sentences, such as Connect this iPhone to another Silo server. Use your language's sentence-ending punctuation.",
