    "calendar.seasonShort" : {
      "comment" : "Abbreviated season label on a small card: on the Roku Calendar screen, and on Android phone and TV episode cards when the episode number is unknown (Android pads to two digits). Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS use it in the video player title and info overlay when an episode has a season number but no episode number. {season}: the season number. Apple iOS and macOS: a downloaded episode's tag in Downloads rows, on its offline page and in the Free Up Space sheet when only the season number is known. Roku also uses it on episode cards when the episode number is unknown (padded to two digits).",
