    "cast.remote.error.lostRoku" : {
      "comment" : "Android phone: Remote Control error shown on the remote and the TV picker; the connection to a Roku dropped and reconnecting failed. {tv}: the Roku's name. Apple iOS: same Remote Control error on the remote after reconnecting to a Roku gave up.",
