    "common.back" : {
      "comment" : "Back button that returns to the previous screen or panel. Roku: for example in the Up Next panel and on screens that cannot load content. Android phone: screen reader label of the back chevron in a player menu panel, the ebook reader's back arrow, and back buttons in Remote Control and Downloads. Android TV: the Back button of the player's Up Next panel, the server address screen, and the secondary button of the audiobook player's error screen. Apple iOS and tvOS: button in the subtitle search sheet or panel after a search failed, returning to the language list. Web: back buttons in admin pages such as backup restore and AI providers.",
