    "common.loading" : {
      "comment" : "Short status text while content is loading. Roku: shown and read aloud by the screen reader. Android phone and TV: screen reader label of the player's loading spinner. Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS: screen reader label of the player's loading spinner, and the Playback status value in the stats panel while loading. Apple iOS: Remote Control remote title while the TV has not sent one yet, and screen reader value of the iPhone and iPad player's play button while the spinner replaces it. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): screen reader label of the Requests loading placeholder, and screen reader state of the New Profile form's Try Again button while libraries reload. Web: shown on the sign-in, password reset and setup wizard screens while they load.",
