    "detail.episode" : {
      "comment" : "Episode label on a series or episode page (Roku series page), also used as the name of an episode without a title. Apple iOS and macOS: series Download sheet and episode option name when the episode has no title. Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS: Up Next panel title for a next episode, shuffle pick or On Deck episode with no title of its own. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV): stand-in title of an untitled episode in the Watch Party picker and lobby. {number}: the episode number. Apple iOS, tvOS and macOS: the second part of an episode card's spoken (VoiceOver) label, as in Season 1, Episode 2, and the title of an untitled downloaded episode in Downloads.",
