    "detail.episodeEyebrow" : {
      "comment" : "Small label above an episode's title on its page (Android phone) and under the episode's title in its page's hero (Apple tvOS). {season}: the season's name, such as Season 2 or Specials; {episode}: the episode number. Numbers are passed as digits, so a year-numbered season reads 2021.",
