    "diagnostics.prompt.notRespondingCountHosted" : {
      "comment" : "Apple diagnostics prompt (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV), shown after a problem report is captured: message when several reports of one kind are waiting: the app stopped responding this many times. Reports go to Silo Diagnostics, the Silo project's hosted service; Silo Diagnostics is a product name. {count}: how many reports (2 or more in practice).",
