    "error.idempotency_conflict" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the server answers with the v2 problem type `idempotency_conflict` (server title: \"Idempotency conflict\"). Clients show it instead of the server's English detail in a translated interface, so it must make sense on its own, without the request's specifics.",
