    "error.installation_changed" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the server answers with the v2 problem type `installation_changed` (server title: \"Playback installation changed\"). Clients show it instead of the server's English detail in a translated interface, so it must make sense on its own, without the request's specifics.",
