    "error.network_identity_required" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the server answers with the v2 problem type `network_identity_required` (server title: \"Network identity required\"). Clients show it instead of the server's English detail in a translated interface, so it must make sense on its own, without the request's specifics.",
