    "error.progress_snapshot_too_large" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the server answers with the v2 problem type `progress_snapshot_too_large` (server title: \"Progress snapshot too large\"). Clients show it instead of the server's English detail in a translated interface, so it must make sense on its own, without the request's specifics.",
