    "error.rate_limited" : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the server answers with the v2 problem type `rate_limited` (server title: \"Rate limited\"). Clients show it instead of the server's English detail in a translated interface, so it must make sense on its own, without the request's specifics.",
