      "comment" : "Title of the default `recommended_movies` row on the Requests Discover page (shared title key `home.section.discoverRecommendedMovies` from title_key on the Discover layout rows). Shown as the row heading on every client, and in the admin Discover layout editor, while the row still has its default title. A row of movies the server does not have, recommended to the viewer from what they watched. Sentence case, unlike the built-in Discover rows.",
