    "library.collectionCard.books" : {
      "comment" : "Apple tvOS: count under an audiobook collection's name on its poster card in a library's Collections page; the app shows it in uppercase. {count}: the number of books. {count_text}: the same number as digits. Android phone: also the caption under a library's name at the top of its Libraries page, counting the audiobooks in the library (or the Browse page's filtered list).",
