    "newProfile.refused.title" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Roku dialog shown when the server refuses to create the profile; the server's own reason appears as the body. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): same alert title when the server refused the new profile; the body is the server's reason.",
