    "notReady.still" : {
      "comment" : "Message on Roku after rechecking, saying the server still needs administrator setup. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): same message after Check again on the server needs setup screen, and after Try again on the saved-server recovery screen.",
