    "player.subtitleSync.resultAlreadyMatches" : {
      "comment" : "Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: result of the last sync when the timing was already right. Shown under the selected subtitle's timing actions in the player: the iOS Audio & Subtitles sheet, the macOS player options panel and the tvOS info panel's Subtitles tab. Android phone and TV player subtitle timing: same result under the timing actions.",
