    "player.subtitles.position.lowerThirdTitleCase" : {
      "comment" : "Android TV: subtitle appearance option in the player subtitles pane and in settings: subtitles raised to the lower third of the picture. Android TV writes option names in title case. Apple iOS/tvOS/macOS: subtitle position option in settings, the player settings sheet and the tvOS player info panel.",
