      "comment" : "Longer status text on the Roku request detail screen: the request was declined. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV): same status text on My Requests rows and the request detail page. Android phone and TV request screens: same status in My Requests rows, the TV preview panel and the detail page.",
