    "requests.summary.needYou" : {
      "comment" : "Phone: part of the Requests page summary card, next to a red dot: how many of the user's requests were declined or failed and need the user's attention. Plural counts the requests. {count}: the number of requests; {count_text}: the same number as text. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Mac): same part of the summary card on the Requests page.",
