    "subtitleSearch.downloadCount" : {
      "comment" : "Android phone and TV: subtitle search result row; how many times the subtitle was downloaded from the provider. {count}: the download count, which picks the plural form; {count_text}: the same number as written, such as 12,345. English says \"downloads\" for 1 too, as the app always has. Apple iOS and tvOS: subtitle search result row detail.",
