    "watchParty.hint.notReady.twoNames" : {
      "comment" : "Roku: hint line shown to the host. {first}: name of one member not ready; {second}: name of the other member not ready. Apple (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV): same hint under the lobby's buttons. Android phone and TV Watch Party lobby: same line under the host's buttons. 1 and 2: guests' names.",
