    "watchParty.suggestion.play" : {
      "comment" : "Apple (iPhone, iPad, Apple TV): Watch Party lobby, button on a guest's suggestion (host-pick party) that makes it the party's title. Shown instead of Queue when the server starts a selected title right away.",
